  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.<br>• Thinly slice onion (see ingredients). <br>• Thinly slice pear into wedges. <br>• Thinly slice silverbeet. <br>• Slice lemon into wedges. <br>• Finely chop garlic.<br>• Roughly chop double cream Brie. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681431aa80e0f84c774d70f4/step-887cc700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil<br>over medium-high heat. Cook onion and sliced<br>mushrooms, tossing, until tender, 6-8 minutes.<br>• Add herb &amp; mushroom seasoning and garlic<br>and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. <br>• Add risotto-style rice and stir to coat. <br>• Add the water (for the rice) and stock <br>concentrate.<br>• Bring to the boil, then remove from heat. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681431aa80e0f84c774d70f4/step-0f66ec10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Transfer risotto to a baking dish.<br>• Cover tightly with foil and bake until liquid is <br>absorbed and rice is ‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes. </p> <p><br>TIP: ‘Al dente’ rice is cooked through but still slightly <br>firm in the centre. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681431aa80e0f84c774d70f4/step-c2dda820.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When risotto has 10 minutes remaining, wash <br>out frying pan and return to medium-high heat <br>with the butter.<br>• Cook pear wedges, turning occasionally, until <br>softened, 2-3 minutes. <br>• Reduce heat to medium-low, then carefully add <br>the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and water <br>(for the pear) and cook until dark and sticky, <br>3-5 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681431aa80e0f84c774d70f4/step-108ed730.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Remove risotto from oven and stir through the <br>chopped Brie until melted. <br>• Stir in silverbeet, a good squeeze of lemon <br>juice, until combined and slightly wilted. Season <br>withh salt and pepper to taste. Stir through a <br>splash of water to loosen risotto, if needed. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681431aa80e0f84c774d70f4/step-48a4fc40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide oven-baked brie and mushroom risotto <br>between bowls. Top with caramelised pears. <br>• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681431aa80e0f84c774d70f4/step-d0636150.jpg"
    }
  ]
